Author: Ferran Pallarès Roca <ferran.pallares.roca@intel.com>
Date:   Fri Jan 28 17:31:01 2022 +0000

    Set truncating stores to expand for myriad4.0 boolean types
    
    InstCombine canonicalizes logical or/and reductions as a bitcast and a
    cmp instruction on plain integer types.
    
    E.g.
    
      %ret = call i1 @llvm.vector.reduce.and.v16i1(<16 x i1> %1)
    
    changes to:
    
      %2 = bitcast <16 x i1> %1 to i16
      %ret = icmp eq i16 %2, -1
    
    The bitcast is then legalized as a truncating store during instruction
    selection, and needs to be expanded (or custom lowered).

