    Reimplementing the "starting group" generator in the mixed vectorizer
    This is part 1 of the task described in Bugzilla ticket #29068. There are still some functional regressions remaining.
    The new generator groups memory accessing instructions together by building a directed acyclic graph of pointers and indices. Nodes in the graph which have a common "parent" sub-graph and have consecutive constant indices access consecutive locations in memory.
