    Moving 'SHAVEPreRASchedPeephole' and 'SHAVEPreRAScheduler' out of the anonymous namespace they are defined in.
    The reason for this is that an anonymous namespace is unique to the Translation Unit, and this means that the 'SHAVEPreRASchedPeephole' and 'SHAVEPreRAScheduler' are different in each TU the header is included, potentially resulting in compile failures (different mangled names for linkage) or undefined behaviour.
    
