    Implementing support for C99 formatted output, specifically the addition of C99 "length modifiers":
    
      o  'hh' for 'char'
      o  'h' for 'short'
      o  'l' for 'long' - this was already handled
      o  'll' for 'long long' - though it still handles INT64 as if it is INT32 (see also bug #23654)
      o  'j' for '[u]intmax_t'
      o  't' for 'ptrdiff_t'
      o  'z' for 'size_t' - see bug #24898
    
